#!/usr/bin/env warp
# the length of each word
length "the quick brown fox".split(" ")
# Very good example to show when broadcasting does not apply and we need the special extra keyword :
# triage-held 2026-10-28: `length all xs`, a keyword to broadcast; `xs.map length` is the form :: length all "the quick brown fox".split(" ")
"the quick brown fox".split.map length
